    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n\n(** ** The third homotopy group of the 2-sphere *)\n\n(** We use the Hopf fibration [S1 -> S3 -> S2] to prove that the homotopy groups of [psphere 2] agree with those of [psphere 3] starting in degree 3.  In particular, [Pi 3 (psphere 2)] is isomorphic to the integers. *)\n\n"
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Section Pi3S2.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Context `{Univalence}.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n\n  (** The 1-sphere is 1-truncated by [istrunc_s1], hence [n.+1]-truncated for any [n]. *)\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Local Instance istrunc_psphere_1 (n : nat) : IsTrunc n.+1 (psphere 1)\n    := @istrunc_leq 1 n.+1 tt _ _.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n\n  (** Therefore its homotopy groups vanish in degrees 2 and above. *)\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Local Instance contr_pi_succ_succ_psphere_1 (n : nat)\n    : Contr (Pi n.+2 (psphere 1))\n    := contr_pi_succ_istrunc n (psphere 1).",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n\n  (** The Hopf construction on the circle gives a pointed family over [psusp (psphere 1)], which is definitionally [psphere 2].  The projection of its total space is the Hopf fibration. *)\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Definition hopf_pr1\n    : psigma (hopf_construction (psphere 1)) ->* psphere 2\n    := Build_pMap pr1 1.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n\n  (** The circle, included as the fiber over the basepoint, gives a fiber sequence. *)\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Definition fiberseq_hopf\n    : FiberSeq (psphere 1) (psigma (hopf_construction (psphere 1))) (psphere 2).",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": [
        {
          "_type": "goal",
          "name": null,
          "conclusion": "FiberSeq (psphere 1) (psigma (hopf_construction (psphere 1))) (psphere 2)",
          "hypotheses": [
            {
              "_type": "hypothesis",
              "names": [
                "H"
              ],
              "body": null,
              "type": "Univalence"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n  "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "Proof.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": [
        {
          "_type": "goal",
          "name": null,
          "conclusion": "FiberSeq (psphere 1) (psigma (hopf_construction (psphere 1))) (psphere 2)",
          "hypotheses": [
            {
              "_type": "hypothesis",
              "names": [
                "H"
              ],
              "body": null,
              "type": "Univalence"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "text",
      "contents": "\n    "
    },
    {
      "_type": "sentence",
      "contents": "exists hopf_pr1.",
      "messages": [],
      "goals": [
        {
          "_type": "goal",
          "name": null,
          "conclusion": "psphere 1 <~>* pfiber hopf_pr1",
          "hypotheses": [
            {
              "_type": "hypothesis",
              "names": [
                "H"
              ],
              "body": null,
              "type": "Univalence"
